# Train Troops ({4}{W} sorcery Adventure): "Create two 2/2 white Knight creature tokens with vigilance." On turn 1 Bot1 casts it
# with two Black Lotuses (white for the {W}, red for the rest): two Knight tokens (white, vigilance) and the card is exiled
# (CR 715.4), not put into the graveyard. Recruiter's own "When this creature enters" ability is not on the Adventure: the
# Knights are plain 2/2s and nothing has haste (CR 715.3b, the spell has only its Adventure half's characteristics).

